WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:12.418
This is my ring.

2
00:00:12.419 --> 00:00:20.581
I have some flowers.

3
00:00:20.582 --> 00:00:28.995
These are musicians.

4
00:00:28.996 --> 00:00:37.377
I have a cake.

5
00:00:37.378 --> 00:00:45.670
These are gifts.

6
00:00:45.671 --> 00:00:53.960
I have a white dress.

7
00:00:53.961 --> 00:01:01.497
This is the groom.

8
00:01:01.498 --> 00:01:09.549
Who am I?

9
00:01:09.550 --> 00:01:16.417
I am a bride.

